{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/prosiform/pulls/663","id":5185591304,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVNSvEM8AAAABNRXYCA","html_url":"https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/pull/663","diff_url":"https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/pull/663.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/pull/663.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/prosiform/issues/663","number":663,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[I10:E07] Specify Explicit Link-Tag Preset Selection","user":{"login":"m2ux","id":176900785,"node_id":"U_kgDOCotKsQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176900785?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux","html_url":"https://github.com/m2ux","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Overview\n\nA Markdown link's title explicitly selects its target's presets: `[Plan Report](guide.md#plan-report \"checks,draft\")` corresponds to `pf --entry guide.md#plan-report --tags checks,draft`. This design contract defines that selection independently of heading wording and specifies the dispatched bundle variants it produces.\n\n## Changes\n\n### Selection Contract\n\n- **Each link supplies its selection.**\n  Comma-separated complete names select the target's presets above default, with unknown tags ignored.\n- **The guide specifies the command.**\n  One entry, optional tags, path resolution and shell quoting apply to direct and deferred compilation.\n\n### Bundle Identity\n\n- **Effective selections distinguish dispatched bundles.**\n  Scheduling, rewriting, cycle checks and validation share document, fragment and matched-preset identity.\n- **Variant names have one exact recipe.**\n  A canonical UTF-8 JSON preset set supplies the SHA-256 qualifier, with collision refusal.\n\n## Test Plan\n\n| Test | Description | Coverage | Pass |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| T1 | Contract-to-confirmed-requirements and planned-fixture review | AC1 | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-06-662-i10-e07-w00-the-design-states-explicit/validation.md#t1-contract-and-fixture-review) |\n| T2 | Internal links, glossary, stale-rule scan, digest and diff checks | AC1 | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-06-662-i10-e07-w00-the-design-states-explicit/validation.md#t2-structural-checks) |\n| T3 | Existing immutable-pin conformance; candidate runtime support remains later work | | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-06-662-i10-e07-w00-the-design-states-explicit/validation.md#t3-existing-pin-conformance) |\n\n## References\n\n- **R1.** [W00 delivery record](https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/tree/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-06-662-i10-e07-w00-the-design-states-explicit) — the immutable candidate pin, clause review and measured validation limits.\n","created_at":"2026-11-06T09:13:58Z","updated_at":"2026-11-06T09:20:16Z","closed_at":"2026-11-06T09:20:16Z","merged_at":"2026-11-06T09:20:16Z","merge_commit_sha":"dfbcca186371e02d8be84514d8f4da25baec6b54","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/prosiform/pulls/663/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/prosiform/pulls/663/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com